{"ref":"BDB, שְׁכֶם²","hw":"שְׁכֶם²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁכֶם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong><sub>49</sub> et <strong>m.</strong>14 (Συχεμ; 𝔊L often Σίκιμα Lag<sup>BN 57</sup>):<br><strong>1.</strong>  district in N. Palestine <strong>(</strong>prob. <em>shoulder</em> (saddle?) of mount.<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מְקוֹם שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:6\" href=\"/Genesis.12.6\">Gn 12:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁכֶ֑מָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:14\" href=\"/Genesis.37.14\">37:14</a>; = city (<span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁכֶם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁכֶ֑מָה</span>, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:9\" href=\"/Hosea.6.9\">Ho 6:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁ֑כְמָה</span>) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:1\" href=\"/Joshua.24.1\">Jos 24:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עִיר שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:18\" href=\"/Genesis.33.18\">Gn 33:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:31\" href=\"/Judges.8.31\">Ju 8:31</a> + 20 times <a data-ref=\"Judges 9\" href=\"/Judges.9\">Ju 9</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">בַּעֲלֵי שׁ׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:2\" href=\"/Judges.9.2\">2</a> + 12 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳ מִגְדַּל־שׁ׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:46\" href=\"/Judges.9.46\">46</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:47\" href=\"/Judges.9.47\">47</a>), <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:9\" href=\"/Hosea.6.9\">Ho 6:9</a> + 21 times (<span dir=\"rtl\">עִיר שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:18\" href=\"/Genesis.33.18\">Gn 33:18</a>); city of refuge <a data-ref=\"Joshua 20:7\" href=\"/Joshua.20.7\">Jos 20:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:21\" href=\"/Joshua.21.21\">21:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:52\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.52\">1 Ch 6:52</a>.—WMM<sup>As. u. Eur. 394</sup>, cp. Egypt. <em>Sa-ka-mà</em> (cf. Jen<sup> ZA x (1895) 356</sup>); mod. <em>Nablûs</em> (from Rom. name Neapolis); v. Buhl<sup>G 200 f.</sup> GASm<sup>G 332 ff. 345</sup> Wilson<sup>Hast. DB shechem</sup>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> n.pr.m.</strong> (on connexion with <strong>1</strong> cf. <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:28\" href=\"/Judges.9.28\">Ju 9:28</a>), ‘son’ of Ḥamor, also <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:19\" href=\"/Genesis.33.19\">Gn 33:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:2\" href=\"/Genesis.34.2\">34:2</a> + 10 times 34, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:32\" href=\"/Joshua.24.32\">Jos 24:32</a>.","next":"BDB, שֶׁ֫כֶם","prev":"BDB, שִׁכְמָה"}